## Import

Only complete generations support explicit import; arbitrary ACL rows and
partial generations cannot be adopted as a policy. Import by bare generation,
for example `terraform import zyxel_acl_policy.https '7f'`. The legacy
`name/generation` form is still accepted but the name is ignored. Current
two-hex, earlier four-hex and legacy 16-hex generation tokens are accepted.
Import restores optional logical rule names; unnamed rows retain null names.

